1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:02,100
Thanksgiving Dinner: How To Spot The Hockey Family

2
00:00:02,200 --> 00:00:04,800
Leaves before pie. Puck drop is 7:50 tomorrow. Three hours away.

3
00:00:04,800 --> 00:00:07,400
Brought the team cooler. There's still a roster taped to the lid.

4
00:00:07,400 --> 00:00:10,000
Checks the bracket during grace. Pool play schedule dropped at 6:12.

5
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:12,600
Skate guards in a coat pocket. Nobody asks. Everybody knows.

6
00:00:12,600 --> 00:00:15,200
Takes leftovers "to go". Destination: hotel mini-fridge.

7
00:00:15,200 --> 00:00:20,900
Every table has one. This year it's ours.

8
00:00:16,400 --> 00:00:21,000
Follow for more from the rink.

